Aims to grow your investment over the long term (5 years or more) through a combination of income and capital returns. It targets an overall average return before charges and taxes of at least 1.30% greater than the performance benchmark per year, measured over 3-year rolling periods. It aims for an average volatility of 45% of the volatility of global equities. It invests in a broad range of global asset classes (including emerging markets) that may include shares, bonds, cash, property, and commodities, and gains this exposure by investing in other funds, directly in these assets, or through the use of derivatives. The fund makes significant use of derivative instruments for investment purposes.
