The projections for the agreed risk level are shown below. They are not intended to provide a guarantee of actual portfolio performance, rather to provide a way to illustrate how different risk levels affect the range of probable returns. Projections take account of an estimated annual total charge of 1.5% which is intended to represent tax wrapper, platform and fund charges as well as any ongoing advice charges. The actual charge will be dependent on the chosen tax wrapper, platform and fund portfolio. The projections model the effects of inflation; all figures are shown in real terms.
