otal cost includes adviser fees. However, the critical yield analysis [P11] states \"An ongoing annual adviser charge of 1% which has been considered as part of both the new and old solution projections below,\" suggesting the adviser fee is included in the critical yield comparison, yet the effect of switching is shown as zero.\n\nThe guard about internal contradictions is also relevant: the report states the same plan's charge in multiple tables, and these figures do not agree. The existing plan is stated as 0.54% in [P5] and 0.6% in [P8]/[P14]. The recommended plan is stated as 0.62% in [P7] and 0.7% in [P8]/[P14]. These internal contradictions make the whole cost comparison unreliable.","citations":[{"passageId":"P1","source":"Suitability Report - Barnes.md","category":"I","quote":"Charges 0.32% platform charge + 0.22% weighted fund charges","cells":null},{"passageId":"P5","source":"Suitability Report - Barnes.md","category":"I","quote":"Current Annual Recurring Charge of Existing Plan 0.54% £427 Impact of Recommended Alternative +0.08% +£63","cells":null},{"passageId":"P7","source":"Suitability Report - Barnes.md","category":"I","quote":"Aviva Platform Personal 0.21% 0.41% 0.62% Pension £173.65 £339.04 £512.69","cells":["Aviva Platform Personal","0.21%","0.41%","0.62%"]},{"passageId":"P8","source":"Pension switch report 16-12-2025 10-06.md","category":"G","quote":"Existing Solution 0.6% £86,800 New Solution 0.7% £86,700","cells":["Existing Solution","0.6%","£86,800"]},{"passageId":"P14","source":"Pension switch report 16-12-2025 10-06.md","category":"G","quote":"Existing Solution 0.6% £86,800 New Solution 0.7% £86,700","cells":["Existing Solution","0.6%","£86,800"]},{"passageId":"P15","source":"Suitability Report - Barnes.md","category":"I","quote":"By moving the pension under TFAS agency, you will benefit from a reduced platform charge from 0.32% to 0.21%.","cells":null},{"passageId":"P11","source":"Suitability Report - Barnes.md","category":"I","quote":"An on