The figures assume that you switch your existing funds and continue the same level of contributions into your new solution. The cost of any transfer penalties applied by the existing provider are included in the calculation by reducing the amount to be invested in the new solution. Values shown are in real terms which mean that they have been adjusted to take into account the effect of inflation.
