- The report states the recommended option costs 0.08% a year more than the existing one, and reports a reduction in yield of 1.8% for the existing plan against 1.7% for the recommended one at High growth. A charge 0.08% higher cannot produce a reduction in yield 0.1% lower than the plan it replaces on the same basis. Either the two comparisons rest on different assumptions, or something has been applied to one side and not the other. The report should say which.
